士兵坚毅眼神。背景是军营帐篷与黄昏余晖，光影柔和，材质真实，手办制服纹理清晰，士兵手指轻抚手办肩章，镜头缓慢推近，营造庄重仪式感。\n\nNext Scene: 士兵站起身，手办从胸前缓缓抬起，镜头环绕手办360度旋转，展现其警察制服与徽章细节。背景切换至训练场沙地，夕阳斜照，士兵侧身站立，手办在光影中投下清晰影子，镜头跟随手办移动，慢速拉远，展现人物与手办的互动张力。\n\nNext Scene: 士兵背对镜头，手办被高高举起，镜头从俯拍角度向下追踪，展现手办在风中微微晃动。背景是开阔训练场与远处靶场，士兵肩扛手办，步伐坚定，镜头快速侧移跟随，光影锐利，材质真实，手办表情生动，士兵背影与手办形成视觉焦点，强化宣传片的动感与力量感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 444, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "626e001a20c4a6ad8f987153538d7ff750cb2850", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [402], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [466.8670349121094, 440.4207458496094], "pos": [2216.3974609375, 198.62850952148438], "widgets_values": ["**Next Scene 1｜**\n中景镜头，灰长袍戴眼镜男子伏案蹲坐在堆积如山的文稿中间，奋笔编写材料，桌面散落大量草稿、涂改废纸。棕熊蹲在一旁，巨大熊掌笨拙抓握钢笔，写得歪歪扭扭；拟人浣熊趴在文件堆上，爪子扒拉散落纸张。人物神态忙乱焦灼，额头略带疲惫。主光源左上方斜射，柔和阴影强化衣褶、动物毛发、纸张纹理。轻微手持晃动，忙碌混乱纪实氛围，纯白空背景，无杂物，电影光影，无噪点畸变。\n\n**Next Scene 2｜**\n侧景镜头，男子、棕熊、拟人狐狸围在巨型堆叠的打印纸堆旁。打印机不停吐出漫天飞扬的打印文稿，纸张四处飘散。男子伸手去接飞舞的纸张手忙脚乱；棕熊试图用熊掌按住乱飞的稿纸，却把纸张拍得漫天飞舞；拟人狐狸蹦跳着扑抓飘散纸张。光线均匀柔和，突出纸张翻飞动态，布料毛发真实，纯白背景，镜头轻微跟随纸张运动，场面混乱喧闹，电影质感，无畸变噪点。\n\n**Next Scene 3｜**\n近景镜头，成堆牛皮纸袋散落在四周，众人慌乱分装材料。男子弯腰快速折叠文稿往纸袋内装填；棕熊硕大的熊掌笨拙地把大把文件塞进牛皮纸袋，部分纸张从袋口滑落；拟人浣熊叼住文件，帮忙递纸袋，忙得团团转。镜头缓慢环绕小幅移动，左上方柔和侧光，突出纸袋褶皱、纸张边缘、毛发衣料细节，纯白背景，忙碌混乱的工作氛围，写实电影光影，无噪点畸变。\n\n**Next Scene 4｜**\n高角度俯拍镜头，男子、棕熊、拟人浣熊、拟人狐狸挤在海量文件与牛皮纸袋中间，满地散落文稿、半装满的纸袋，部分文件洒落一地。男子扶着眼镜面露疲态，棕熊坐地上，爪子扒拉散落袋子，小动物们也瘫在纸堆间隙。镜头从上方缓慢拉远，展现整片混乱的文件海洋。柔和均匀顶光，纯白空白背景，突出全部角色姿态、文件堆错落层次，动作自然连贯，电影级写实质感，无噪点畸变。\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 406, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 405, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 455, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 458, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 470, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 45, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.20.3", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "COMBO", "links": [], "label": "COMBO", "type": "*", "localized_name": "COMBO"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Next Scene 1: Medium shot, cramped workstation with towering stacks of monitors and laptops, printers wedged in gaps, several printers billowing thin white smoke from overload. Waste paper swirls in the air and thick discarded documents carpet the ground. East‑Asian man with glasses in grey robe hunches over laptop typing frantically, exhausted and flustered. Brown bear squeezes beside him, smashing keyboard with huge paws garbling on‑screen text. Goofy anthropomorphic husky shakes its body sending stacks of paper flying; slow‑moving sloth lazily prods keyboard keys; large shoebill stork stands atop monitor pecking clumsily at laptop screen; raccoon, hare and goat scuttle between hardware knocking loose more documents. Key light slants from top‑left, mixed soft‑hard shadows accentuate feathers, fur, fabric folds and device textures. Subtle handheld shake, documentary‑style hectic mood, solid pure‑white background, no extra scenery, cinematic lighting, no noise, no distortion.\nNext Scene 2: Side shot, dense rows of stacked printers. Many units are overloaded, spouting sheets wildly, several printer casements curl with wispy white smoke. Tons of waste paper swirl and drift through the whole frame. Man in grey‑robe scrambles fruitlessly to restrain paper output. Brown bear swats printers with paws, unleashing even bigger surges of paper. Husky leaps and chases floating scraps; sloth hangs lazily from printer frame, letting waste sheets pile over its body; shoebill stork opens its huge beak trying to catch falling paper; fox and raccoon dart about amid the paper storm. Tight cramped space, humans, animals and hardware pressed closely together. Soft even lighting captures dynamics of flying paper and smoking printers, realistic fine‑detail for feathers, fur and electronics. Pure white background, slight camera drift following drifting scraps, loud out‑of‑control chaos, photorealistic cinematic render, no noise, no distortion.\nNext Scene 3: Medium close‑up, tight confined space ringed by laptops and monitors. Kraft bags, staplers, USB drives and tangled cables litter ground, buried under thick layers of waste paper with scraps constantly drifting down. Man rapidly folds, staples and packs documents into file bags. Brown bear shovels handfuls of paperwork into sacks with sheets constantly slipping out. Husky snatches paper bags and runs about; sloth slowly inserts sheets one by one; shoebill stork shoves paper into bags clumsily with its beak, most scraps tumble back out; raccoon, goat and hare cause mischief among paper heaps. Slow subtle orbiting camera movement, top‑left side‑light highlights bag creases, hardware casing, feathers and fur details. Pure white background, high‑pressure chaotic work mood, cinematic lighting, no noise, no distortion.\nNext Scene 4: High overhead shot, camera slowly pulls backward from top‑down perspective revealing the full chaotic scene. Dense stacks of monitors, laptops and multiple smoking malfunctioning printers fill frame. Waste paper floats all through the air and the floor is buried deep under discarded sheets. Man in grey robe, brown bear, husky, sloth, shoebill stork, raccoon, fox, goat and hare are squeezed together amid an ocean of electronics and paper. Half‑filled file bags and tangled cables scattered everywhere. Man adjusts glasses with deep exhaustion, brown bear slumps atop paper piles; husky rolls deep inside waste‑paper drifts; sloth hangs partly off monitor edge; shoebill stork stands amid paper heaps; other animals slump messily all over. Soft even top‑down lighting, solid pure‑white background, emphasize crowded layered visual chaos, natural continuous motion, photorealistic cinematic quality, no noise, no distortion.", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 466, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "label": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "start_index"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "label": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_rows"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [722.5408935546875, 358.5316467285156], "pos": [-457.47314453125, 548.3504638671875], "id": 44, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "8ecc929cd41cf0f7ef6fcc45d4bbc5729c6f287f", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"start_index": true, "max_rows": true, "prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptLine"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [466, 467, 469], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-968.7689208984375, 210.59182739257812], "widgets_values": ["", "去空行"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "input_string"}, "name": "input_string", "link": 465, "label": "input_string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "input_string"}, {"widget": {"name": "option"}, "name": "option", "label": "option", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "option"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7